{"unit_id":"KYinCode__dsh-hooks-plugin#card-zh","repo":"KYinCode/dsh-hooks-plugin","commit":"5dd8d6490ad77df1adf92ee9b356f0d9cbdff0d7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hooks 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的生命周期钩子插件，可在智能体和工具事件发生时运行配置的命令或 HTTP hook。它将四层 hooks.json 配置接入智能体控制器，支持事件和工具匹配、条件过滤、串行执行、决策结果反馈，并在 shell.overlay 提供按会话查看的浮动记录控制台。主要功能包括全局、预设和项目配置合并，工具调用前后及会话事件触发，配置热重载，以及最近记录持久化和日志轮转。适合希望为 DSH 工作流添加自动化脚本、事件通知或工具决策的用户。使用 Node.js 20 或更高版本，并通过 hooks.json 配置；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:47","index.mjs:1176-1246","client/index.js:325-339","package.json:1"]}
{"unit_id":"KYinCode__dsh-hooks-plugin#card-en","repo":"KYinCode/dsh-hooks-plugin","commit":"5dd8d6490ad77df1adf92ee9b356f0d9cbdff0d7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hooks runs configured commands or HTTP handlers on DSH agent and tool events. It loads layered hooks.json files, filters events by matcher and conditions, and can return decisions. A session scoped console shows recent records, which persist locally. Requires Node.js 20+; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:47","index.mjs:1176-1246","client/index.js:325-339","package.json:1"]}
